  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Ocean Time Series Data of the East China Sea by PMEL FOCI Program (PMEL EPIC)",
  "description": "This one-dimensional ocean data set indexed by time, includes ocean temperature, pressure, salinity, conductivity, etc. from the East China Sea. There are 22 files available for plotting and download. Depth range was from 0 to 177 meters deep. Data were collected by the PMEL FOCI program, and the data are available through PMEL EPIC program. [PMEL - Pacific Marine Environmental Laboratory (http://www.pmel.noaa.gov/), FOCI - Fisheries-Oceanography Coordinated Investigations (http://www.pmel.noaa.gov/foci/home.html)]\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To support oceanographic time series.",
